{"schemaVersion":1,"articles":[{"id":"monsters.monster.kobold.statblock.kobold-princeps","title":"Кобольд-принцепс","chapter":"23. Бестиарий","group":"Кобольды","path":"Monsters/monster/kobold/statblock/kobold-princeps.md","originalId":"mcdm.monsters.v1/monster.kobold.statblock/kobold-princeps","originalName":"Kobold Princeps","originalDescription":"| Humanoid, Kobold  |         -         |     Level 1      |             Minion Support              | EV 3 for four minions |\n|:-----------------:|:-----------------:|:----------------:|:---------------------------------------:|:---------------------:|\n|  **1S**<br>Size   |  **5**<br>Speed   | **4**<br>Stamina |           **0**<br>Stability            | **1**<br>Free Strike  |\n| **-**<br>Immunity | **-**<br>Movement |        -         | **+2 bonus to Stamina**<br>With Captain |   **-**<br>Weakness   |\n|  **0**<br>Might   | **+2**<br>Agility | **0**<br>Reason  |           **0**<br>Intuition            |   **0**<br>Presence   |\n\n> 🗡 **Hasta (Signature Ability)**\n>\n> | **Melee, Strike, Weapon** |                          **[Main action](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.combat/turn)** |\n> |---------------------------|-----------------------------------------:|\n> | **📏 Melee 2**            | **🎯 One creature or object per minion** |\n>\n> **Power Roll + 2:**\n>\n> - **≤11:** 1 damage\n> - **12-16:** 2 damage\n> - **17+:** 3 damage\n>\n> **Effect:** One ally within 3 squares of the princeps [shifts](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/movement/shifting) up to 2 squares.\n\n> ⭐️ **Shield? Shield!**\n>\n> While [adjacent](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.combat/adjacent) to an ally who also has this trait, the princeps has stability 1, has cover, and grants cover to allies.","director":{"section":"monsters","sourcePath":"monster/kobold/statblock/kobold-princeps.json","sourceRevision":"bdb12093b1d07bf8674453796eac907a09dd7dd3","groupSlug":"kobold","recordType":"statblock","level":1,"ev":"3 for four minions","size":"1S","keywords":["Гуманоид","Кобольд"],"role":"Поддержка","organization":"Миньон"},"blocks":[{"type":"entity","ref":"monster.kobold.statblock.kobold-princeps"},{"type":"entity","ref":"monster.kobold.kobold-malice"}],"related":[{"id":"monsters.monster.group.kobold","title":"Кобольды"},{"id":"monsters.monster.kobold.kobold-malice","title":"Раздор кобольдов"},{"id":"monsters.rule.monster.malice","title":"Раздор"}],"originalCoverage":{"status":"complete"}}],"entities":[{"id":"monster.kobold.statblock.kobold-princeps","kind":"monster","name":"Кобольд-принцепс","markdown":"| Гуманоид, Кобольд | - | Уровень 1 | Поддержка миньонов | Боевая ценность 3 за четырёх миньонов |\n|:-----------------:|:-----------------:|:-----------------:|:---------------------------------------:|:---------------------:|\n| **1S**<br>Размер | **5**<br>Скорость | **4**<br>Выносливость | **0**<br>Устойчивость | **1**<br>Свободный удар |\n| **-**<br>Иммунитет | **-**<br>Передвижение | - | **+2 к Выносливости**<br>С капитаном | **-**<br>Уязвимость |\n| **0**<br>Мощь | **+2**<br>Ловкость | **0**<br>Разум | **0**<br>Интуиция | **0**<br>Присутствие |\n\n> 🗡 **Гаста (знаковая способность)**\n>\n> | **Ближний бой, Удар, Оружие** | **[Основное действие](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.turn)** |\n> |-------------------------------|---------------------------------------------:|\n> | **📏 Ближний бой 2** | **🎯 Одно существо или объект на каждого миньона** |\n>\n> **Бросок силы + 2:**\n>\n> - **≤11:** 1 урон\n> - **12-16:** 2 урона\n> - **17+:** 3 урона\n>\n> **Эффект:** Один союзник в пределах 3 клеток от принцепса [смещается](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.shift) не более чем на 2 клетки.\n\n> ⭐️ **Щит? Щит!**\n>\n> Пока принцепс находится [рядом](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.adjacent) с союзником, у которого тоже есть эта черта, его Устойчивость равна 1, у него есть укрытие, и он даёт укрытие союзникам.\n","source":{"articleId":"monsters.monster.kobold.statblock.kobold-princeps","path":"Monsters/monster/kobold/statblock/kobold-princeps.md"},"originalId":"mcdm.monsters.v1/monster.kobold.statblock/kobold-princeps","originalName":"Kobold Princeps","originalDescription":"| Humanoid, Kobold  |         -         |     Level 1      |             Minion Support              | EV 3 for four minions |\n|:-----------------:|:-----------------:|:----------------:|:---------------------------------------:|:---------------------:|\n|  **1S**<br>Size   |  **5**<br>Speed   | **4**<br>Stamina |           **0**<br>Stability            | **1**<br>Free Strike  |\n| **-**<br>Immunity | **-**<br>Movement |        -         | **+2 bonus to Stamina**<br>With Captain |   **-**<br>Weakness   |\n|  **0**<br>Might   | **+2**<br>Agility | **0**<br>Reason  |           **0**<br>Intuition            |   **0**<br>Presence   |\n\n> 🗡 **Hasta (Signature Ability)**\n>\n> | **Melee, Strike, Weapon** |                          **[Main action](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.combat/turn)** |\n> |---------------------------|-----------------------------------------:|\n> | **📏 Melee 2**            | **🎯 One creature or object per minion** |\n>\n> **Power Roll + 2:**\n>\n> - **≤11:** 1 damage\n> - **12-16:** 2 damage\n> - **17+:** 3 damage\n>\n> **Effect:** One ally within 3 squares of the princeps [shifts](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/movement/shifting) up to 2 squares.\n\n> ⭐️ **Shield? Shield!**\n>\n> While [adjacent](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.combat/adjacent) to an ally who also has this trait, the princeps has stability 1, has cover, and grants cover to allies.","director":{"section":"monsters","sourcePath":"monster/kobold/statblock/kobold-princeps.json","sourceRevision":"bdb12093b1d07bf8674453796eac907a09dd7dd3","groupSlug":"kobold","recordType":"statblock","level":1,"ev":"3 for four minions","size":"1S","keywords":["Гуманоид","Кобольд"],"role":"Поддержка","organization":"Миньон"},"originalCoverage":{"status":"complete"},"printedCreature":{"ru":[0,[[6,[[2,["Гуманоид, Кобольд"],{"data":{"$":{"s":"keywords"}}}],[2,["Уровень 1"],{"data":{"